WEBVTT

00:11:59.227 --> 00:12:02.543
If it's not, start looking
for something else.

00:12:02.567 --> 00:12:05.778
Specifically, start looking
for a way that you can move

00:12:05.802 --> 00:12:08.105
into instruction mode.

00:12:08.669 --> 00:12:11.075
AG: In Arthur's case,
after giving up on music,

00:12:11.099 --> 00:12:13.849
he spent years running
a conservative think tank.

00:12:13.873 --> 00:12:16.931
And then having learned the lessons
of his fall at Carnegie Hall,

00:12:16.955 --> 00:12:18.286
he took his own advice.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:20.222
AB: And I had somebody I really respect,

00:12:20.246 --> 00:12:23.953
and he said, "You know,
when you are a chief executive

00:12:23.977 --> 00:12:26.848
and you have to be
on the razor's edge every single day,

00:12:26.872 --> 00:12:30.385
you have two choices on how to step out
of your chief executive job."